1. Runtime dependencies (Python packages)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These are installed with the application and, on Windows, embedded in the
installer.

  NumPy                     2.5.3    BSD-3-Clause (*)
    Copyright (c) 2005-2026, NumPy Developers. All rights reserved.
    https://numpy.org/
    (*) Bundled components carry their own permissive licenses, including
        0BSD, MIT, Zlib, Apache-2.0 and the LAPACK/OpenBLAS BSD terms; see
        LICENSE.txt in the numpy distribution for the complete list.

  OpenCV (opencv-python-headless)   4.14.0.94
