      https://github.com/opencv/opencv-python
    The wheel additionally bundles compiled third-party libraries, among
    them FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1-or-later), libjpeg-turbo (IJG / BSD-3-Clause /
    zlib), libpng (PNG Reference Library License v2), OpenJPEG
    (BSD-2-Clause), libwebp (BSD-3-Clause), libtiff, zlib, FreeType (FTL)
